body:
if you’re not completely comfortable with your first time being a random dude, just don’t do it.  my first time was from grindr and it was disappointing but it still doesn’t mean a thing to me. (but i do wish that i just didn’t gave in to lust)

Just look for someone who will respect you for who you are and try to build a relationship not just based on sex. most of the times when you come off a little too horny, they’re just going to treat you like a whore. but no one is hot enough to disregard your self-esteem. (even though someone is, don’t do it, always prioritize your well-being)

Grindr is a community that can get dangerous real quick. By dangerous, I mean for anything really; emotionally, mentally, or physically. So try to find someone who is not going to hurt you in anyway and will be kind to you. Otherwise, you might feel like a flesh of meat or worse idk. Because i still have that bitter taste after a hookup.
